        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira lisuuvira, Nyasaye yageriza Aburahamu ahaane Isaka mwana weve muderwa, ave kuli kisiuviriru. Aburahamu niye wa Nyasaye yalombera lisuuvirizwa yilio. Kali ndio, yavugilira kuhaana mwana weve muderwa kuli kisiuviriru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye yaali niyavoolera Aburahamu, “Visukululwi vivio vilakanyoleke kuvitira mu Isaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu yasuuvira ndi Nyasaye yaali unyala kusimugukiza Isaka kutura mu likuzu; kandi kovora agiligali, Aburahamu yanyoora mwana weve kutura mu likuzu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
